ummary":"Tinna Rubber reported strong financial performance for Q1 FY27, with consolidated revenue increasing by 20% and significant expansion in EBITDA and PAT margins. The company is scaling its construction chemicals business through capacity expansion and marquee project execution. Management is actively pursuing international growth, including new facilities in Saudi Arabia and South Africa, while focusing on renewable energy integration. The company also successfully monetized its accrued EPR credits and is expanding its tyre recycling capacity. Tinna Rubber reported strong FY26 performance with record tire processing volumes and EBITDA margins exceeding 17%.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The steel abrasives business is expected to achieve approximately 30% volume growth in FY27.","quote":"The steel abrasives business is expected to achieve ~30% volume growth in FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects 20% to 25% revenue growth in FY27 compared to the previous year.","quote":"What I can tell you on overall revenue is we are expecting about 20% to 25% growth in revenue in FY27 from the previous year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"},{"claim":"The company aims to achieve revenue of INR1,000 crores while maintaining EBITDA margins of over 18% as part of Vision 2029.","quote":"We aim to achieve revenue of INR1,000 crores while maintaining EBITDA margins of over 18%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The company expects a temporary reduction in infrastructure business demand in Q1 and Q2 due to bitumen availability issues.","quote":"One is we expect some reduction possibly in the infra business during Q1, Q2 of this year. And that is probably, it will be because of less availability of bitumen.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management anticipates robust growth in the industrial sector driven by the need for recycled rubber materials.","quote":"However, we are seeing very robust growth in our industrial sector. That is driven by, due to these crisis, the benefit that we have seen is there is higher motivation for blending of rubber in bitumen as well as for use of recycled rubber materials in new products.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company completed Rs. 27 Cr. of capex in Q1 FY27 against a planned investment of Rs. 100 Cr. for FY27\u2013FY28.","quote":"Completed Rs. 27 Cr. of capex in Q1 FY27 against the planned ~Rs. 100 Cr. investment over FY27\u2013FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The ongoing 3,500 MTPA MRP capacity expansion is on track for commissioning by Q3 FY27.","quote":"The ongoing 3,500 MTPA MRP capacity expansion is progressing as planned and remains on track for commissioning by Q3 FY27, increasing the Company's total MRP capacity to 20,000 MTPA.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The company earmarked INR100 crores of capex over FY27 and FY28.","quote":"We remain committed to investing in the business and have earmarked a further INR100 crores of capex over FY27 and '28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is enhancing its polymer compounding facility in Haryana to reach 18,000 tons per annum by the end of Q1 FY27.","quote":"In line with our expansion strategy, we are enhancing the capacity of our polymer compounding facility in Haryana, which is expected to reach 18,000 tons per annum by the end of Q1 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Renewable energy initiatives contributed savings of INR 1.19 Cr for Q1 FY27.","quote":"Renewable energy (Solar Power) has contributed savings of INR 1.19 Cr for Q1FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The company achieved robust EBITDA margins of over 17% in FY26.","quote":"FY26 was another year of strong execution for Tinna Rubber, despite geopolitical uncertainties and a dynamic operating environment, we achieved record tire processing volumes and delivered robust EBITDA margins of over 17%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"},{"claim":"Nearly 50% of power requirements are expected to be met through renewable sources from FY27 onwards to support cost efficiency.","quote":"Nearly 50% of our power requirements are expected to be met through renewable sources from FY27 onwards, supporting both our ESG objectives and cost efficiency efforts.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company secured a 15,000 MT rubberized bitumen processing order for execution during FY27.","quote":"Secured a 15,000 MT rubberized bitumen processing order, scheduled for execution during FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"Tinna Rubber expanded its tire-crush capacity in India by 9% to 185,000 tons in FY26.","quote":"We continue to strengthen our processing capabilities during FY26 and expanded our tire-crush capacity in India by 9% to 185,000 tons.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"},{"claim":"The Varale plant has reached a capacity utilization of 80%.","quote":"The Varale plant, the newest of our plants, has now reached capacity utilization of 80%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The inventory of accrued EPR credits up to 31 March 2026 was fully monetized in Q1 FY27.","quote":"The inventory of accrued EPR credits up to 31 March 2026 was fully monetized in Q1 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The Board recommended a final dividend of INR3.25 per equity share for FY26.","quote":"In line with our commitment to delivering sustainable value to our shareholders, I am pleased to inform the Board has recommended a final dividend of INR3.25 per equity share for FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"},{"claim":"Debt declined 10% to INR121 crores in FY26.","quote":"Balance sheet strength improved in FY26 with debt declining 10% to INR121 crores from INR134 crores in the previous financial year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Geopolitical uncertainties in West Asia and the GCC region are impacting project implementation timelines.","quote":"Management has prudently revised the project implementation timeline in light of evolving geopolitical uncertainties in West Asia and the GCC region, as ongoing supply chain and logistics disruptions continue to impact the broader industry.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The company delayed capital works for the Saudi Arabia facility due to Middle East tensions.","quote":"However, due to the Middle East tensions, we thought it prudent to delay the commencement of the capital works and we are closely monitoring the situation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company plans to commission the 3,500 MTPA MRP capacity expansion.","quote":"The ongoing 3,500 MTPA MRP capacity expansion is progressing as planned and remains on track for commissioning by Q3 FY27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 FY27"},{"claim":"Earmarked INR100 crores of capex over the next two years.","quote":"So over next 2 years, another INR100 crores of capex is foreseen by us.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"Expect both pyrolysis and rCB plants to be in full operation.","quote":"we expect both the plants to be in full operation by Q3 of FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f35ad6e2-c478-4f67-8ebd-6d1ea557d82e.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":23,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":10,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}